=== let wages = dataset(wages)
wages.glm(union ~ educ, family: binomial).confusion(newdata: wages.add(union = union * 2)) ===
--- messages ---
note: `union` replaced the variable of that name (line 2)
error[Z0401]: `union` is 2 in a row of `newdata`, and `confusion` needs an outcome of 0 and 1
