2 | wages.glm(union ~ educ, family: binomial).confusion(newdata: wages.add(union = union * 2))
  |                                                              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ an outcome that is not 0 or 1
  |
  = help: the outcome of `newdata` is coded as the outcome the model was fitted to
[exit 1]

